      "designator": "25-0",
      "grouping_at_time": "Subpart E \u2014 Powerplant",
      "title_at_revision": "Fire protection: other components.",
      "text": "(a) Surfaces to the rear of the nacelles, within one nacelle diameter of the nacelle centerline, must be at least fire-resistant.\n(b) Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply to tail surfaces to the rear of the nacelles that could not be readily affected by heat, flames, or sparks coming from a designated fire zone or engine compartment of any nacelle.",
